\fs24
\b NestJS Server – Deployment Checklist\b0\par
\par
\bullet Environment\par
\tab - NODE_ENV=production\par
\tab - ConfigModule with schema validation\par
\tab - Secrets loaded from vault or env\par
\par
\bullet Build\par
\tab - Multi-stage Dockerfile\par
\tab - npm ci for reproducible installs\par
\tab - \lang1033 tsconfig target ES2022; source maps off in prod\par
\par
\bullet Security\par
\tab - Helmet enabled\par
\tab - Rate limiting / throttler\par
\tab - CSRF only when using cookies\par
\tab - CORS restricted to known origins\par
\par
\bullet App Hardening\par
\tab - Global ValidationPipe (whitelist, transform)\par
\tab - Global exception filter with safe error responses\par
\tab - Logging: structured (pino), requestId correlation\par
\par
\bullet Observability\par
\tab - /health endpoint and readiness/liveness probes\par
\tab - Metrics (Prometheus) and tracing headers\par
\par
\bullet Runtime\par
\tab - Fastify adapter for throughput\par
\tab - Graceful shutdown (enableShutdownHooks)\par
\tab - Horizontal scaling behind a reverse proxy\par
\par
\bullet Data\par
\tab - Migrations applied (TypeORM/Prisma)\par
\tab - Connection pooling tuned\par
\par
\bullet Docs & DX\par
\tab - Swagger at /docs with auth\par
\tab - Versioned APIs and deprecation headers\par
}
